:''"This booming coastal city is run by [[Baron Revilgaz]] of the [[Blackwater Raiders]]. Mortal enemies of the [[Bloodsail Buccaneers]] and part of the [[Steamwheedle Cartel]]."''
::— Faction in-game description

'''Booty Bay''' is a large pirate town nestled into the cliffs surrounding a beautiful blue lagoon on the southern tip of [[Stranglethorn Vale]]. The city is entered by traversing through the bleached-white jaws of a giant shark. Run by the [[:Category:Blackwater Raiders|Blackwater Raiders]] who are closely associated with the [[Steamwheedle Cartel]], the port offers facilities to any traveller passing through, regardless of their faction. Combined with the world renowned Salty Sailor Tavern, it is one of the most popular locations in [[Azeroth]].

==History==
The area was previously known as the '''Blackwater Cove'''<ref name="WharfmasterDizzywig" /><ref name="TheBarrensPort" /> and was described as a large, sheltered, semi-circular cove surrounded by cliffs at the southern end of [[Stranglethorn Vale]]. It was a former small port town inhabited by [[human]]s which was overrun by [[jungle troll]]s.<ref>[https://wowpedia.fandom.com/wiki/The_World_of_Warcraft_Townhall/World_Map The World of Warcraft Townhall/World Map]</ref><ref>[http://web.archive.org/web/20040204231548/http://www.blizzard.com/wow/townhall/stranglethorn.shtml Original Stranglethorn Vale description]</ref><ref>[http://pc.gamespy.com/pc/world-of-warcraft/568788p1.html The Artistry of World of Warcraft: Stranglethorn Vale (PC)]</ref> Eventually, the [[goblin]]s of the [[Steamwheedle Cartel]] managed to drive out the trolls from the immediate area to claim the shores of the cove for their new center for operations in the [[Eastern Kingdoms]] &mdash; Booty Bay.<ref name="WharfmasterDizzywig">{{Horde}} [11] [[Wharfmaster Dizzywig (Barrens)]]</ref><ref name="TheBarrensPort">{{Alliance}} [30] [[The Barrens Port]]: Most likely Velinde found a trading vessel in Ratchet to take her to Blackwater Cove in Azeroth.</ref><ref>{{Alliance}} [30] [[Passage to Booty Bay]]: Velinde. Booked passage to Booty Bay on the Black Osprey.</ref>

===World of Warcraft===
Following the [[Third War]], Booty Bay was still run by the [[Blackwater Raiders]] who are closely associated with the [[Steamwheedle Cartel]], the port offers facilities to any traveler passing through, regardless of their faction. As the ruler of this city, [[Baron Revilgaz]] hires all the help he can get against the pesky [[Bloodsail Buccaneers]] and other threats to the city. He resides, together with the leader of the [[Blackwater Raiders]], [[Fleet Master Seahorn]], at the top of the inn of Booty Bay.

Outside of Booty Bay, on the island of [[Janeiro's Point]], is a giant statue of an unknown [[goblin]] with outstretched arms.

