==Reputation==
Killing the [[Bloodsail Buccaneers]] and [[Venture Co.]] in Stranglethorn will increase your [[reputation]] with the [[Steamwheedle Cartel]].

An alternative to killing Bloodsail Buccaneers is to do the repeatable quest [[Cartel Gold Donations]] from [[Clemence the Counter]] in the [[Old Port Authority]], which gives 250 reputation with all Steamwheedle Cartel factions per 10 gold turn-in.

